Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:30:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] hip: group decode KV-cache set_rows stores into one launch

A decode step stores the new K row and the new V row into the KV cache with
two independent set_rows launches over disjoint tensors. Merging adjacent
single-row F32->F16 set_rows stores into one launch removes dispatches
without touching any value: each element keeps its source, its cast and its
destination address. GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_SET_ROWS_GROUP=1 restores stock.

Ported from laguna-xs-2.1-gguf-r9700-v1 0007.

